{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"起初他觉得，总算【不用再受委屈】了\",\"source\":\"起初还觉得自己总算不用再一次次委屈自己了。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿强调的是不必再反复委屈自己、迁就自己，屏幕稿变成不必再受别人委屈，改变了委屈的来源和具体含义。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"那阵难受缓了下来，他【没再压着心里的想念】\",\"source\":\"这回没急着拿受过的气压住这份想念。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是这一次没有急着用过去受的气压住想念，屏幕稿变成不再压抑想念，扩大了原本只是当下的一次态度变化。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1a40946-cd94-48ca-91c9-0f3940fe7adf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T220754313096Z", "elapsed_seconds": 219.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:11:33.449522+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2b50237bac3ebbe7fff864373a3c12e7c014f5f6eb8c7ef85a4d6d93c9983d4c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002570